      "text": [
        " «إِذَا نَزَلْتَ قُرَاكَ وَ أَرْضَكَ فَأَتِمَّ اَلصَّلاَةَ وَ إِذَا كُنْتَ فِي غَيْرِ أَرْضِكَ فَقَصِّرْ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1307 - Ismail ibn al-Fadl asked Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) about a man who travels from one land to another but resides in his own villages and properties.\nImam (as) said: \"If you stay in your own village or land, then complete the prayer; if you are in land that is not yours, then shorten the prayer.\""
        ]
      }
